# The curated lineup has separate local-market blocks (Madison, Green Bay,
# Milwaukee locals all exist as distinct channels) -- found in review,
# 2026-08-17: the fuzzy substring fallback below picks whichever
# same-network channel happens to iterate first, which for a Packers game
# broadcast on a national/regional affiliate (FOX, NBC, ...) isn't
# guaranteed to be the Green Bay one. Worst case is recording a different
# market's feed of the same game rather than a wrong game entirely, but
# worth getting right given how much of this project already treats team
# broadcast markets deliberately (RSN_DEFAULTS, etc).
